    "https://charleston.edu/academic-affairs/faculty-information/index.php": {
      "title": "Faculty Information",
      "description": "College of Charleston | Faculty Information Return to College of Charleston homepage MyPortal The Hub Alumni Give Visit Apply What're you looking for? What're you looking for? Search About College of Charleston About College of Charleston Home College at a Glance History & Traditions Looking to the Future Leadership & Administration Offices Facilities Community Academics Academics Home Find Your Program Meta-Majors Colleges & Schools Centers & Institutes Study Abroad & International Ed Research Opportunities Academic Resources & Services Online Degrees Cost & Aid Cost & Aid Home Tuition & Fees Apply for Aid Loans Scholarships Grants Pay Your Bill Student Life Student Life Home Housing & Dining Athletics Activities Calendar Clubs & Organizations Support & Services Service & Leadership Campus Resources Life in Charleston Admission Admission Home Apply Visit the College Parents & Families Admitted Students Request Information MyPortal The Hub Alumni Give Visit Apply Faculty Information Faculty Information Welcome to the Faculty Information page! At the College of Charleston, we value our faculty members and are dedicated to providing them with the resources they need to excel in their roles as educators, researchers, and mentors. This page serves as a central hub for faculty-related information, offering various resources and tools to support your professional development and enhance your teaching and research endeavors. On this page, you will find a collection of valuable resources that cover a wide range of topics relevant to faculty members. Whether you are seeking information on teaching strategies, research support, tenure guidelines, or faculty policies, we have gathered essential resources to assist you in navigating your academic career. Faculty/Administration Manual Teaching From class planning and scheduling to operations and grading, we have so many resources for you. View Teaching Resources Faculty Research Research is a cornerstone of the College of Charleston's brand. It's important for you to model good research habits to our students. This is where you'll find information on how the College can support you in your faculty research. View Faculty Research Tenure, Promotion and Third-year Review You'll want to review the Faculty Administration Manual for more details, but in this section of the website, we outline what these terms mean at the College of Charleston and what you can expect as you approach each professional milestone. View Tenure & Promotion Information New Faculty Information To help with your onboarding, please read the information provided in your appointment and below. If you have any questions, please contact your department, dean, or the Provost's Office. View New Faculty Information Faculty Activity System Faculty Activity System (FAS), also known as Activity Insight™, compiles teaching, research, and service data for various reports, aiding faculty and administration communication. View Faculty Activity System International Faculty Resources The Center for International Education (CIE) assists with hiring international employees, offering visa services and immigration information. View International Faculty Resources Celebration of Faculty 2023 At the end of each academic year, we gather to celebrate faculty, nominated by their peers, for their excellence in teaching, research, and advising. In This Section Teaching Faculty Research Tenure & Promotion Celebration of Faculty New Faculty Information Faculty Activity Reporting (Interfolio FAR) International Faculty Resources Contact Office of the Provost, Division of Academic Affairs Randolph Hall Suite 209/210 66 George Street Charleston, SC 29403 provost@cofc.edu (843) 953-5527 Apply Now Visit Us Request Info Library Bookstore Alumni Give Directory Newsroom Events Careers Campus Map Emergency Info 66 George Street, Charleston, SC 29424 USA\n\t\t\t\t| 843.805.5507 Policies & Procedures Title IX Accessibility Transparency Copyright © 2026 College of Charleston. All Rights Reserved."
